    "detailed_description": "Lunatic Taxi Driver is an exciting and fast-paced game that puts you in the shoes of a taxi driver who is determined to show the world what it means to be a truly exceptional driver. Your goal in Lunatic Taxi Driver is to pick up passengers, transport them to their destination, and do it all with speed, efficiency, and style. But being a great taxi driver isn't just about speed and skill - it's also about customer service. In Lunatic Taxi Driver, you'll need to keep your car clean, well-maintained, and fully fueled at all times, while also being friendly, courteous, and professional with your passengers. Even if you break the rules of the road in your quest for speed, you'll always make sure that your passengers are safe and comfortable. Whether you're a seasoned driver or just looking for a fun and challenging simulation game, Lunatic Taxi Driver is sure to provide hours of thrilling entertainment. So why wait? Get behind the wheel and start driving today!<br><br><strong>Game features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 business taxis<br></li><li>2 Game Modes ( City / Offroad)<br></li><li>20 levels</li></ul>",
